cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "LogicGate"
abstract: >-
  An offline digital logic synthesis and timing analyzer datasheet bench.
  Provides Boolean equation parsing, truth tables, exact SOP and POS
  realisation, Gray-coded Karnaugh maps, gate-level and clocked netlist
  simulation, and Verilog export.
type: software
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/draarivpatel-ui/logicgate"
url: "https://draarivpatel-ui.github.io/logicgate/"
keywords:
  - digital-logic
  - boolean-algebra
  - quine-mccluskey
  - karnaugh-map
  - verilog
  - datasheet
  - javascript
  - zero-dependency
